000078             PERFORM 2000-PROCESSAR
000079                THRU 2000-FIM-PROCESSAR
000080                   UNTIL WS-FS-ENT-FIM
000081             PERFORM 3000-FINALIZAR
000082                THRU 3000-FIM-FINALIZAR
000083             STOP RUN.
